AROMA_OF_CHAOS.pages.MAINTAIN_CONTROL.de:
You resist the temptation to yield, driving your massive claws deep into the stone and frozen earth beneath you. Though the aroma cannot sway your body, its lingering tendrils still tear at your mind.
Keeping your sanity is no easy feat; you anchor your thoughts tightly to your creed.
{AromaPrinciple}
{AromaPrinciple}
{AromaPrinciple}
The aroma gradually fades away.
